decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.usedCommRing\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">usedCommRing</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`usedCommRing` is `true` if the `CommRing` has been used to normalize expressions.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.usedCommRing","kind":"def","line":438,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.usedCommRing","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L438-L438"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.divMod\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">divMod</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashSet.html#Lean.PHashSet\">PHashSet</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Basic.html#Int\">Int</a>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Pairs `(x, n)` s.t. we have expanded the theorems\n- `Int.Internal.Linear.ediv_emod`\n- `Int.Internal.Linear.emod_nonneg`\n- `Int.Internal.Linear.emod_le`","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.divMod","kind":"def","line":434,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.divMod","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L434-L434"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqSplits\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">diseqSplits</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashMap.html#Lean.PHashMap\">PHashMap</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Poly\">Poly</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Cache decision variables used when splitting on disequalities.\nThis is necessary because the same disequality may be in different conflicts.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqSplits","kind":"def","line":427,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqSplits","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L427-L427"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.conflict?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">conflict?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.UnsatProof\">UnsatProof</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`conflict?` is `some ..` if a contradictory constraint was derived.\nThis field is only set when `caseSplits` is `true`. Otherwise, we\ncan convert `UnsatProof` into a Lean term and close the current `grind` goal.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.conflict?","kind":"def","line":422,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.conflict?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L422-L422"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.numReorderRequests\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">numReorderRequests</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Number of reorderings requested by the model search, bounded by `liaReorders`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.numReorderRequests","kind":"def","line":416,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.numReorderRequests","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L416-L416"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.penalties\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">penalties</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentHashMap.html#Lean.PHashMap\">PHashMap</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/ExprPtr.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.ExprPtr\">ExprPtr</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Maps the term of a variable to the number of times the model search was about to open a Cooper\nsplit on it and requested a reordering instead (see `requestReorder`). `reorderVars` uses the\ncount as the primary sort key, so that these variables are assigned first and become parameters\nof the bounds they conflicted in. The map is keyed by the term rather than by the variable index\nbecause `reorderVars` renumbers the variables; the term is the identity that survives.\nIt stays empty unless a reordering is requested.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.penalties","kind":"def","line":414,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.penalties","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L414-L414"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.steps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">steps</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Cumulative number of steps performed by the model search.\nThe model search is interrupted when this counter reaches the `liaSteps`\nconfiguration threshold, and the solver becomes incomplete.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.steps","kind":"def","line":405,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.steps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L405-L405"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.caseSplits\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">caseSplits</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`caseSplits` is `true` if cutsat is searching for model and already performed case splits.\nThis information is used to decide whether a conflict should immediately close the\ncurrent `grind` goal or not.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.caseSplits","kind":"def","line":399,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.caseSplits","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L399-L399"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.nextCnstrId\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">nextCnstrId</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Next unique id for a constraint.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.nextCnstrId","kind":"def","line":393,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.nextCnstrId","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L393-L393"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.assignment\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">assignment</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Rat/Basic.html#Rat\">Rat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Partial assignment being constructed by cutsat.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.assignment","kind":"def","line":391,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.assignment","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L391-L391"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.occurs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">occurs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.VarSet\">VarSet</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Mapping from variable to occurrences. For example, an entry `x ↦ {y, z}` means that `x` may occur in `dvdCnstrs`, `lowers`, or `uppers` of\nvariables `y` and `z`.\nIf `x` occurs in `dvdCnstrs[y]`, `lowers[y]`, or `uppers[y]`, then `y` is in `occurs[x]`, but the reverse is not true.\nIf `x` is in `elimStack`, then `occurs[x]` is the empty set.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.occurs","kind":"def","line":389,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.occurs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L389-L389"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimStack\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">elimStack</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#List\">List</a> <a href=\"./Init/Data/Int/Linear.html#Int.Internal.Linear.Var\">Var</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elimination stack. For every variable in `elimStack`. If `x` in `elimStack`, then `elimEqs[x]` is not `none`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimStack","kind":"def","line":382,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimStack","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L382-L382"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.active\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">active</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`active[x]` is `false` if `x` was created in a case of the model search that has been backtracked.\nBacktracking keeps `x` because the proofs of refuted cases may use it, but rolls back the constraints\nasserted when `x` was created. `mkVar` reactivates `x` by asserting them again.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.active","kind":"def","line":378,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.active","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L378-L378"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimEqs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">elimEqs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.EqCnstr\">EqCnstr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Mapping from variable to equation constraint used to eliminate it. `solved` variables should not occur in\n`dvdCnstrs`, `lowers`, or `uppers`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimEqs","kind":"def","line":372,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.elimEqs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L372-L372"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">State</span>.<span class=\"name\">diseqs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State\">State</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Lean/Data/PersistentArray.html#Lean.PArray\">PArray</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.DiseqCnstr\">DiseqCnstr</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Mapping from variables to their disequalities. We say a disequality constraint `c` is a disequality for a variable `x`\nif `x` is the maximal variable in `c`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqs","kind":"def","line":367,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.diseqs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L367-L367"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.State.uppers\"><span class=\