">CooperSplitProof</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The last case which has type `(cooper_*_split ... 0)`","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof.last","kind":"ctor","line":197,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof.last","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L197-L198"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof.dec\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">Cutsat</span>.<span class=\"name\">CooperSplitProof</span>.<span class=\"name\">dec</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof\">CooperSplitProof</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The first `n-1` cases are decisions (aka case-splits).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof.dec","kind":"ctor","line":195,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof.dec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.lean#L195-L196"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Arith/Cutsat/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Arith.Cutsat.CooperSplitProof\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</spa